	quest.4F4057C698BB5718.quest_desc: [
		"&2&l&nHow spawning trainers work&r&n &2(straight from the WIKI)&r"
		""
		"The strength of a player is determined by the strongest pokemon in their party but will never go above the players level cap (level cap is desabled, at least on our official server)"
		""
		"The strength of a trainer is determined in the same way"
		""
		"Only trainers with the same or less strength will spawn around a player"
		""
		"Trainers that have not been defeated by a player have a much higher chance to spawn"
		""
		"Key trainers will get a boost in their spawn chance if the pokemon in the team of a player are above or approach that players level cap"
		""
		"It is impossible for multiple trainers with the same identity to spawn (including different versions of the same trainer)"
		""
		"Different trainer types will spawn in different biomes (spawn locations for each trainer can be found in the trainer card)"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&2&n&nNPC AI&r"
		""
		"Follow any player nearby holding a trainer card"
		""
		"If unable to battle (e. g. defeated) wander towards a previously chosen direction (so they get aways from any players and despawn)"
		""
		"If nearby a village go to it and wander around"
		""
		"Get close to a player nearby that is best fit for a battle (up to a certain radius)"
		""
		"Aimlessly wander around"
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"&n&2The Type of trainer is shown by the color of there name&r"
		""
		"&l&nTYPE - Colour - Symbol&r"
		""
		"Normal - White - No symbol"
		"&6Rival - Gold - R&r"
		"&aLeader - Green - L&r"
		"&1E4 - Dark Aqua - E&r"
		"&5Champ - Dark Purple - C&r"
		"&8Team Rocket - Dark Gray - T&r"
	]
