	quest.68D909A9123613F2.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to: Forbidden and Arcanus."
		"Full of magical content, and beautiful textures!"
		""
		"[\"\",{\"text\":\"Click For Wiki\",\"color\":\"blue\",\"bold\":true,\"underlined\":false,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"open_url\",\"value\":\"https://wiki.valhelsia.net/external-mods/forbidden-and-arcanus/wiki\"}}] "
		"(may be out of date)"
