	]
	quest.692BC44C7B9AF3B4.quest_desc: [
		"This simple and basic mod allows you to zoom in on an area using a command. This works server-side as well so you don't need this installed on the client. Simply use the trigger command &l/trigger darkzoom&r and you will enter a zoomed mode which will show you a zoomed view of what you are seeing. This effect lasts for 2 seconds and can be reactivated again."
		""
		"Note: This makes use of the in-game FOV function. Make sure your FOV slider is at 100% for this to work correctly."
	]
	quest.694372C448477D6F.quest_desc: [
		"Dropped by The Wither"
		""
		"Has witnessed destruction. Maybe it also witnessed your stuff disappear"
	]
	quest.6944ED782E2947B0.quest_desc: ["The Overworld is the primary dimension in Minecraft. It has a wide variety of unique biomes to explore, and is easily the most diverse of the dimensions. Players will typically spend most of their time in this dimension."]
